🧠 1. Multilayer Switch (3560-24PS — Core & Inter-VLAN Routing)
Plaintext
enable
configure terminal

! 🏷️ Identitas & Banner
hostname SW-CORE-3560
banner motd # 🛑 Akses Terbatas: SW-CORE-3560 (Inter-VLAN Routing & ACL) 🛑 #

! 🌐 Pembuatan VLAN Departemen & Management
vlan 10
name IT-DEPT
vlan 20
name HR-DEPT
vlan 30
name FINANCE-DEPT
vlan 40
name GUEST-ZONE
vlan 99
name MANAGEMENT
exit

! 🔌 Konfigurasi Trunk Uplink ke Router1 & Downlink ke Access Switch
interface GigabitEthernet 0/1
description Link ke Router1
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk native vlan 99
no shutdown
exit

interface GigabitEthernet 0/2
description Link ke SW-ACCESS-2960
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk native vlan 99
no shutdown
exit

! 🔀 Aktivasi Routing & Gateway SVI Tiap VLAN
ip routing

interface Vlan 10
description Gateway IT-DEPT
ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

interface Vlan 20
description Gateway HR-DEPT
ip address 192.168.20.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

interface Vlan 30
description Gateway FINANCE-DEPT
ip address 192.168.30.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

interface Vlan 40
description Gateway GUEST-ZONE
ip address 192.168.40.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit

! 🛡️ Kebijakan Keamanan: Blokir HR (192.168.20.0/24) -> Finance (192.168.30.0/24)
ip access-list extended ACL-HR-TO-FINANCE
deny ip 192.168.20.0 0.0.0.255 192.168.30.0 0.0.0.255
permit ip any any
exit

interface Vlan 20
ip access-group ACL-HR-TO-FINANCE in
exit

end
write memory
🔍 Cek cepat di SW-CORE-3560:

show vlan brief — pastikan seluruh VLAN (10, 20, 30, 40, 99) terdaftar.

show ip route — pastikan rute C (connected) muncul untuk keempat subnet VLAN.

show access-lists ACL-HR-TO-FINANCE — pantau hit counter saat uji ping dari HR ke Finance.
